WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.790
The final SELECT exposes the results of the pipeline
Phone candidates

00:00:05.817 --> 00:00:11.455
are only kept when they satisfy the ten-digit
teaching rule Unsupported

00:00:11.482 --> 00:00:18.239
dates remain NULL Duplicate rank remains visible The

00:00:18.266 --> 00:00:24.430
row status flags records that still contain
important unresolved problems This

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:29.049
is what transparent cleaning looks like useful
output plus visible uncertainty
